{"id":"1c3eda9b-0fe1-8183-a9b7-d84a300aee4e","title":"code","parentId":"1c3eda9b-0fe1-817b-b022-cacd442a920c","category":"알고리즘","categoryId":"source:알고리즘","createdAt":"2025-03-27T07:47:31.359Z","updatedAt":"2025-03-27T07:47:31.359Z","markdown":"<a id=\"1c3eda9b0fe181edbe2df87dec252d70\"></a>\n\n```java\nimport java.lang.reflect.Array;\nimport java.util.*;\n\n\n\n\n\npublic class Main {\n    public int Solution(int n, ArrayList<Time> arr){\n        Collections.sort(arr);\n        for(int i=0; i<arr.size(); i++){\n            System.out.println(arr.get(i).time + \" \"+ arr.get(i).state);\n        }\n        int answer=0, cnt=0;\n        for(Time ob : arr){\n            if(ob.state=='s')  cnt++;\n            else cnt--;\n            answer=Math.max(answer, cnt);\n        }\n        return answer;\n    }\n\n    public static void main (String[] args){\n        Main T = new Main();\n        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n        int n=sc.nextInt();\n        ArrayList<Time> arr = new ArrayList<>();\n        for(int i=0; i<n; i++){\n            int s=sc.nextInt();\n            arr.add(new Time(s, 's'));\n            int e=sc.nextInt();\n            arr.add(new Time(e, 'e'));\n        }\n        System.out.println(T.Solution(n, arr));\n    }\n}\n```\n","path":"posts/1c3eda9b-0fe1-8183-a9b7-d84a300aee4e/code.md","url":"https://beautiful-college-c84.notion.site/1c3eda9b0fe18183a9b7d84a300aee4e","excerpt":"java import java.lang.reflect.Array; import java.util.; public class Main { public int Solution(int n, ArrayList arr){ Collections.sort(arr); for(int i=0; i arr = new ArrayList ();","cover":null,"icon":null,"order":0,"revision":"34fd3b079c84b703b806d1beb9bd452cf1bcfc73882981777a3a9751c366232e","bodyLoaded":true}